                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9a70e21b-03e6-40c4-a407-1432668e3378",
                                "sense_id": "f908c861-1024-3fea-a406-1c7777aca614",
                                "text": "They have come to think of the universities, the civil service, and the media – the old Althusserian ISAs – with its orthodoxy of egalitarianism, democracy and social constructionism, as the Cathedral; a quasi-religious structure that functions hegemonically to supress^([sic]) dissent."
